# hair/adult/crownbraid: Crown braid: the hair drawn back from the brow and braided in a band over the crown from ear to ear
# P2b wave 2, HAIR. On the adult head box (STYLE_P2 21; man and woman). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
body adult
role hair crownbraid
layer hairFront
anchor head
keys rest

